@page "/"

<PageTitle>BaseRz</PageTitle>

<h1>BaseRz</h1>

<p class="lead">
    Unstyled, accessible, headless UI primitives for Blazor WebAssembly, Blazor Server, and .NET MAUI Blazor Hybrid.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">The headless contract</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Components emit ARIA attributes, <code>data-*</code> state, and your <code>class</code> only. No built-in CSS.</li>
    <li>Roles and keyboard behavior follow the WAI-ARIA Authoring Practices.</li>
    <li>Stateful roots support controlled (<code>@@bind-Open</code>) and uncontrolled (<code>DefaultOpen</code>) use.</li>
    <li>State is exposed as <code>data-state</code>, <code>data-disabled</code>, <code>data-orientation</code>, <code>data-side</code>, and <code>data-align</code> for styling.</li>
</ul>

<p class="text-muted small">
    This sample app uses Bootstrap for its own chrome only. BaseRz does not depend on Bootstrap.
</p>
